\cf1\b\fs36 Ready to create\b0\cf2\fs22\par
\cf3 Your NPPL PrintMaster workspace is installed.\cf2\par
\b Built by Yatesh Rohit\b0\par
\cf3 Author and developer | IT Department | Nirmal Poly Plast Pvt. Ltd.\cf2\par
\cf1\b 1. Choose your interface\b0\cf2\par
Open Settings to keep Current UI or try Modern UI (Preview). Click Save preferences to remember your choice.\par
\cf1\b 2. Build your first collage\b0\cf2\par
Open Image Collage, choose your image files or folder, then set the paper size, orientation and grid. Select Arrange Images to review the page.\par
\cf1\b 3. Save and export\b0\cf2\par
Save an editable layout if you want to return to it later. Review the page arrangement, choose your output folder and export your finished PDF.\par
\cf1\b 4. Keep PrintMaster current\b0\cf2\par
Help > Software Updates lets you check for a newer published version and download its installer. Startup checks stay quiet unless a newer downloadable update is available.\par
\cf1\b Need a hand?\b0\cf2\par
Open Help > FAQ & How to Use inside PrintMaster. Your project layouts and exported files remain in the folders you chose.\par
